    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>NO THING soundtrack</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The year is 1994 and it is the future.</h2><br>NO THING is a minimalistic surreal action game set in a totalitarian regime of future.<br><br>Tells the story of an office clerk who is sent with an important message to the Queen of Ice.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NO THING Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> radical gameplay<br></li><li> migraine inducing<br></li><li> weird storyline<br></li><li> retro surrealistic full 3D graphic<br></li><li> full voiceover and speech synthesis<br></li><li> chiptune sounds<br></li><li> original cold wave music<br></li><li> simple controls<br></li><li> easy to play, very hard to master<br></li><li> platforms: Windows, Mac, Linux<br></li><li> the year is 1994 and it is the future </li></ul>",
